  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"491\" id=\"isPasted\">Humble Suds is a women-founded company on a mission to clean up the cleaning aisle with non-toxic, plant-based products that actually work — and smell amazing. Founded by two moms, we believe cleaning should be safe, effective, and even joyful. Our line is handcrafted in small batches, packaged in sustainable materials (glass and compostable paper), and infused with pure essential oils — never synthetic fragrance. Made with familiar, safe and effective plant- and mineral- ingredient to be tough on grime but safe for people, pets and the planet.&nbsp;</p><hr data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"496\"><h3 data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"528\"><strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"528\">• Product Description:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"931\">We offer a line of multipurpose, eco-friendly cleaning products made with thoughtfully sourced, non-toxic ingredients. From our best-selling super concentrated sensitive skin formulated laundry soap to our signature Scour Cleaning Paste and All Purpose Cleaners, each formula is designed to deliver powerful results without compromising your health or the planet. Every product is free of synthetic fragrance and harsh chemicals.</p><hr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"936\"><h3 data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"975\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"975\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1392\"><li data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1064\"><p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1064\">Plant- and mineral-based ingredients clearly listed on packaging — no greenwashing or vague “proprietary blends”</p></li><li data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1138\"><p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1138\">Sustainably packaged for sustainability and product integrity. Orders are shipped with eco-friendly materials</p></li><li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1202\"><p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1202\">Mood-boosting essential oils instead of synthetic fragrance</p></li><li data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1246\"><p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1246\">Handcrafted in small batches in the USA</p></li><li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1326\"><p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1326\">Guided by radical transparency, zero-waste values, and ingredient integrity</p></li><li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1392\"><p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1392\">Loved by customers who’ve switched from big-name “clean” brands</p></li><li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1392\"><p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1392\">Love by media as well! Domino Magazine, Real Simple Magazine, The TODAY Show, ApartmentTherapy, Buzzfeed, Forbes and more!</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1397\"><h3 data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1423\"><strong data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1423\">• Payment Terms:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1499\">Commissions are paid every 45 days, with a minimum payout threshold of $35.</p><hr data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\"><h3 data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1534\">• Other Information:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1997\"><li data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1677\"><p data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1677\">Affiliates earn $15 for each new customer referral (minimum $25 order), plus 10–20% commission on all future purchases from that customer.</p></li><li data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1728\"><p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1728\">We do not allow commissions on self-referrals.</p></li><li data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1844\"><p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1844\">Affiliates will receive custom tools, discount codes, and curated content to help them share with authenticity.</p></li><li data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1997\"><p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1997\">Our affiliate community is called <strong data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1901\">Humble Advocates</strong> — a group of conscious, ingredient-aware individuals who believe clean should mean truly clean.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
